   Examine the source code or the logic used to map input to output. For example, in challenges such as the one involving obfuscated PowerShell (context [Document 2]), the transformation table encoded parts of the code to obfuscate or transform it. Similarly, in the .NET encryption function example (context [Document 3]), the transformation involved modular arithmetic and character conversion.

